1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,728
If you cannot boil it, you can still clean it. Three ways.

2
00:00:05,328 --> 00:00:08,914
The Well. Part two of three. The boiling point.

3
00:00:09,514 --> 00:00:13,125
There was a dead rat. I tried to get it out. I did not tell anyone.

4
00:00:13,725 --> 00:00:16,028
A rat does not poison forty-one people.

5
00:00:16,628 --> 00:00:19,641
Twelve meters. It should be thirty.

6
00:00:21,488 --> 00:00:23,444
I wanted nobody walking out there at night.

7
00:00:25,088 --> 00:00:27,790
Smoke is a signal. The dead come to smoke.

8
00:00:29,228 --> 00:00:33,943
Fifty years I boiled water inside the stove. The chimney hides the smoke.

9
00:00:34,543 --> 00:00:38,193
For the sick: one liter, six sugar, half a salt.

10
00:00:39,223 --> 00:00:43,058
Boil one minute. Sun six hours. Bleach thirty minutes.

11
00:00:44,263 --> 00:00:45,370
Two fevers broke.

12
00:00:46,963 --> 00:00:49,225
I will drink it myself. Proof.

13
00:00:49,525 --> 00:00:51,655
Drink that and I will boil you.

14
00:00:52,255 --> 00:00:55,081
Someone is drawing water. From the bad well.

15
00:00:56,215 --> 00:01:00,153
Part two of three, The Well. Next: the handle.
